      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riverside_Township%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Riverside sits where the Delaware River meets Rancocas Creek, a waterway important since prehistoric times.",
